BugReports: https://github.com/finleya/magComp/issues
Description: Fits Bayesian magnitude-composition models for fixed-area stem
    counts and point-sampling basal area. A negative-binomial magnitude model
    describes overall abundance, and multinomial allocation distributes it
    among categories. Models support regression, group, spatial, and space-time effects,
    composition factors, smoothing across ordered categories, posterior
    prediction, and area-weighted summaries.
